ate":"2014-08-20T13:03:25-07:00","id":235695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/235466-ragara-bhagwei-is-the-best-character-in-this-goddamned-game?p=235687#post235687\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I swear to the Dragons, you blow up one student with your penis and no one ever lets it go...</div> </div> </div> </div>I admit, of all the factoids on that list that was the one I was most likely to point at and say &quot;Okay, if only one of these is fake, it's that one.&quot;<br /> <br /> ... Did... Did Bhagwei really blow someone up with his Mighty Green Jade Direlance?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T13:15:04-07:00","id":235707,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/235466-ragara-bhagwei-is-the-best-character-in-this-goddamned-game?p=235695#post235695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I admit, of all the factoids on that list that was the one I was most likely to point at and say &quot;Okay, if only one of these is fake, it's that one.&quot;<br /> <br /> ... Did... Did Bhagwei really blow someone up with his Mighty Green Jade Direlance?</div> </div> </div> </div>He so did!<br /> <br /> Well, sort of.<br /> <br /> Bhagwei had this theory that it was possible to emulate the flow of fate through the flows of Essence involved in the reproductive act, in order to guarantee a 100% chance of bearing Exalted children. He designed specific tantric exercises, found a partner in the person of a young Heptagram student with a thing for older men, and they had awesome tantric sex, which he supplemented with an Artifact channeling and amplifying their Essences.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, it appears that his partner had not accurately performed her preparatory exercises. While in the act, she proceeded to glow green, dematerialize, and, with one convulsion, exploded into a nimbus of Essence.<br /> <br /> He did not repeat the experience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":67,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","user":"Omicron","date":". 08-20-2014, 04:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T13:23: