3-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-20T13:40:56-07:00","id":235721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/235466-ragara-bhagwei-is-the-best-character-in-this-goddamned-game?p=235710#post235710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aspect Book: Wood also has a scene where a dragon-blood exalts while having sex and manages to send his partner to the infirmary with explosive elemental force of his cum. Also, that one dynast who chokes to death while having sex with her son.<br /> <br /> Let's just say some writers have themes that are near and dear to their hearts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, the Outcaste character's mother was raped by a passing Dynast and the trauma left her insane and unable to care for herself.<br /> <br /> Light-handed this book is not. <br /> <br /> It's still good, though! I don't want to scare people away. <br /> <br /> (mostly the writing never couches it in terms as blatant as we describe them)<br /> <br /> I don't remember the mother-choking-to-death, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],